<title>UK: ATHLETICS-BALDINI, XIUJUAN TO COMPETE IN LONDON RACE.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-BALDINI, XIUJUAN TO COMPETE IN LONDON RACE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>World half marathon champions Stefano Baldini of Italy and China's Xiujuan Ren will compete in the London Marathon next month, organisers said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Russia's Yakov Tolstikov, the 1991 men's winner, will also contest the race on April 13.</p>
<p>London marathon race director David Bedford said the Chinese Athletics Federation had requested to send a team, including Xiujuan, to the event.</p>
</text>
